{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Borrow a cat\u2019s help when you\u2019re scared!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Help me Cats&quot; is a 3D horror adventure game where you advance while repelling evil spirits\u2014and sometimes, get help from cats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step into the mansion your pet cat wandered into, it turns out to be another world swarming with countless evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge or repel their attacks as you chase after your beloved pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if progressing becomes too difficult, the ghost cats you met before entering the mansion might stand up against the evil spirits in your place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/1d25e059cd228ef56d9c2b2da90abcb5.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/b8939b7e669760e14cdc0cdb5bf006f0.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the otherworld, various evil spirits will come to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your actions from different options, dodge enemy strikes, or launch your own attacks to drive them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful\u2014if your mental strength drops to zero, you too will become a spirit and be swallowed by the otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/c43d335682aabefa620293e0108fdf20.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/2321bcce62b4a7fde76ee1ffceef03bc.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/eebfda81ed8d6e7fd66424695d9bb581.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an evil spirit is right in front of you, hold down \u201cE\u201d to use the item \u201cCat\u2019s Hand\u201d, and a ghost cat will come to your aid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/b1f2dfce562588f51d14f98a86c72243.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/7e0cb4815e6ad8fdb9d480bd1dd8730d.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/4e01bbd5d0543eeabdf3b9fa90f92069.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/cc16d0d8aa57a42898dcf25d25f9ef4b.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/5ddd4c3b95a9f7441ef531f676ce05e8.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ghost cats are reliable allies that can drive away any evil spirit, but since the \u201cCat\u2019s Hand\u201d can only be used three times in total across all stages, you\u2019ll need to carefully decide when to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Number of Endings]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Regarding Streaming and Video Uploads]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream or upload videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a company or an individual, you may play, stream, or upload videos without needing to contact us for permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also fine if you earn revenue from streaming or uploading videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please include the game\u2019s title (\u201cHelp me Cats\u201d only is fine) in the title of your video or stream, and include the URL of this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Sharing the bonus ending collection (SP), which is unlocked after collecting all endings, on networks or other platforms is prohibited. However, it is allowed if you hide that part of the screen while streaming or uploading videos.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040170?t=1759294951","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/614fdaca77ce30385fd314a803f7f878ca6809b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759294951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/21c015dcc88b537db22368fa391e7bd194544498/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759294951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/21c015dcc88b537db22368fa391e7bd194544498/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759294951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri