eight=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/2321bcce62b4a7fde76ee1ffceef03bc.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/eebfda81ed8d6e7fd66424695d9bb581.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an evil spirit is right in front of you, hold down \u201cE\u201d to use the item \u201cCat\u2019s Hand\u201d, and a ghost cat will come to your aid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/b1f2dfce562588f51d14f98a86c72243.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/7e0cb4815e6ad8fdb9d480bd1dd8730d.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/4e01bbd5d0543eeabdf3b9fa90f92069.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/cc16d0d8aa57a42898dcf25d25f9ef4b.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/5ddd4c3b95a9f7441ef531f676ce05e8.avif?t=1759294951\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ghost cats are reliable allies that can drive away any evil spirit, but since the \u201cCat\u2019s Hand\u201d can only be used three times in total across all stages, you\u2019ll need to carefully decide when to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Number of Endings]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Regarding Streaming and Video Uploads]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream or upload videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a company or an individual, you may play, stream, or upload videos without needing to contact us for permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also fine if you earn revenue from streaming or uploading videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please include the game\u2019s title (\u201cHelp me Cats\u201d only is fine) in the title of your video or stream, and include the URL of this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Sharing the bonus ending collection (SP), which is unlocked after collecting all endings, on networks or other platforms is prohibited. However, it is allowed if you hide that part of the screen while streaming or uploading videos.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AquaEternity"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/88e4a316332ed7260740245f1ef98926cb60692a/header.jpg?t=1759294951","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Help me Cats","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bi